  ['Staff and student resumption','September','Date set each session'],['Orientation and welcome programme','September','Date set each session'],['First PTA meeting','First term','Date set each session'],['Academic quiz and debate','First or second term','Date set each session'],['Mid-term break','As approved','Date set each session'],['Second PTA meeting and career day','Second term','Date set each session'],['Cultural day and sports activities','Second or third term','Date set each session'],['Third PTA meeting','Third term','Date set each session'],['Final examinations and SS3 projects','Third term','Date set each session'],['Prize-giving, graduation and closing','End of session','Date set each session']
